ed from the Xiaomi Mi A2\n(sdm660-xiaomi-jasmine) enabling eMMC, USB, UART, WCN3990 Bluetooth, the\nAdreno 512 GPU (zap shader), the PMIC (charger, fuel gauge, power and\nvolume keys) and the DJN HX83112A 1080x2160 DSI panel.\n\nThe in-cell touchscreen is not yet wired up.\n\nAssisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-4-8\nSigned-off-by: Adrian Nguyen <thenguyen1024@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"24506000c251890a615b79874425fccb9926ba87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdm660-mainline/linux/git/trees/24506000c251890a615b79874425fccb9926ba87"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdm660-mainline/linux/git/commits/224e48717abe345aa33b54c743b64315d9bc937c","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdm660-mainline/linux/commits/224e48717abe345aa33b54c743b64315d9bc937c","html_url":"https://github.com/sdm660-mainline/linux/commit/224e48717abe345aa33b54c743b64315d9bc937c","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sdm660-mainline/linux/commits/224e48717abe345aa33b54c743b64315d9bc937c/comments","author":{"login":"fudio101","id":38380477,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MzgwNDc3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38380477?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fudio101","html_url":"https://github.com/fudio101","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fudio101/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fudio101/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fudio101/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fudio101/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fudio101/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fudio101/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fudio101/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fudio101/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fudio101/received_events","type":